oughout the varied stages!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979470/extras/31bb31ffe59841c490e37fba30606aeb.poster.avif?t=1720816995\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979470/extras/31bb31ffe59841c490e37fba30606aeb.webm?t=1720816995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979470/extras/31bb31ffe59841c490e37fba30606aeb.mp4?t=1720816995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
